WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.360 --> 00:00:02.193
SPEAKER 1: The Google
Cloud platform channel

00:00:02.193 --> 00:00:04.980
has hit 500,000 subscribers.

00:00:04.980 --> 00:00:06.505
Thank you for your
continued support

00:00:06.505 --> 00:00:08.880
in growing this community and
for sharing your excitement

00:00:08.880 --> 00:00:10.680
and curiosity
around Google Cloud.

00:00:10.680 --> 00:00:13.110
SPEAKER 2: This year has
been challenging for everyone

00:00:13.110 --> 00:00:14.818
as we all try to adapt
to the new normal.

00:00:14.818 --> 00:00:17.110
SPEAKER 3: Whether you're
pivoting your business model,

00:00:17.110 --> 00:00:19.230
learning new skills, or
just hoping for a friendly

00:00:19.230 --> 00:00:20.605
five-minute distraction--

00:00:20.605 --> 00:00:22.230
SPEAKER 1: --we
genuinely want to help.

00:00:22.230 --> 00:00:23.647
SPEAKER 2: Our
goal is to continue

00:00:23.647 --> 00:00:26.410
to create useful and
inspiring content for you.

00:00:26.410 --> 00:00:28.960
So if there's a topic you
would like to learn about--

00:00:28.960 --> 00:00:30.750
SPEAKER 3: --please let us
know in the comments below.

00:00:30.750 --> 00:00:33.083
SPEAKER 1: And be sure to
stay tuned for upcoming series

00:00:33.083 --> 00:00:36.150
on data loss prevention,
best practices when scaling,

00:00:36.150 --> 00:00:37.530
and Cloud Function tutorials.

00:00:37.530 --> 00:00:39.780
SPEAKER 2: Thank you again
for subscribing and showing

00:00:39.780 --> 00:00:40.415
your support.

00:00:40.415 --> 00:00:41.790
SPEAKER 3: To show
our thanks, we

00:00:41.790 --> 00:00:43.582
put together some
behind-the-scenes footage

00:00:43.582 --> 00:00:45.480
of the studios that
we really miss.

00:00:45.480 --> 00:00:47.044
Here's to another 500k.

00:00:47.044 --> 00:00:48.700
[BEEP]

00:00:48.700 --> 00:00:51.404
SPEAKER 4: Tweak 51, take 2.

00:00:51.404 --> 00:00:52.577
[GRUNTS]

00:00:52.577 --> 00:00:53.410
SPEAKER 5: 33 outro.

00:00:53.410 --> 00:00:55.370
Take 1.

00:00:55.370 --> 00:00:55.870
[BEEP]

00:00:55.870 --> 00:00:56.412
SPEAKER 6: 1.

00:00:56.412 --> 00:00:58.672
Take 4.

00:00:58.672 --> 00:00:59.638
Deep breath.

00:00:59.638 --> 00:01:01.070
[BEEP]

00:01:01.070 --> 00:01:01.570
[LAUGHTER]

00:01:01.570 --> 00:01:02.237
SPEAKER 7: Yeah.

00:01:05.805 --> 00:01:06.513
SPEAKER 8: Asian.

00:01:06.513 --> 00:01:06.896
SPEAKER 9: All right.

00:01:06.896 --> 00:01:07.088
Cool.

00:01:07.088 --> 00:01:08.240
I'm glad, because
implementation would have

00:01:08.240 --> 00:01:09.658
